      "chunk_id": "84449836-ae54-4586-bd04-f660ce86157c",
      "content": "API Standards\n\nPublic API endpoints must return stable error shapes with `code`, `message`, and `request_id`. Breaking changes require a versioned endpoint or a compatibility period of at least 90 days.\n\nAPIs that expose customer or employee data must enforce authorization before database fetches whenever practical. If pre-fetch filtering is not possible, the exception must be documented in the design review.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002009",
      "document_id": "ENG-001",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    },
    {
      "access_roles": [
        "Manager",
        "IT/Admin"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "014701f0-175b-4b6b-b62e-a98c0ac91a33",
      "content": "Do Not Reveal\n\nDo not disclose internal incident timelines, unreleased architecture details, operational bypass steps, or security review exceptions to unauthorized users. Authorized users may receive operational summaries that are necessary for their role.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002009",
      "document_id": "ENG-001",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    },
    {
      "access_roles": [
        "Employee",
        "Sales Representative",
        "Manager",
        "HR Admin",
        "IT/Admin"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "641b43bd-0e3e-47fd-87e5-20318fd50820",
      "content": "Sharing Rules\n\nEmployees may share data only with people who have a business need and appropriate access. Confidential and Restricted data must not be shared in public channels or with unapproved external recipients.\n\nSales materials may be shared externally only when marked as customer-approved or public-facing.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002003",
      "document_id": "IT-003",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    },
    {
      "access_roles": [
